WEBVTT

02:13.560 --> 02:14.400
Alright.

02:18.600 --> 02:20.680
Sheng Dalang is gone.

02:22.560 --> 02:23.960
He's gone.

02:33.960 --> 02:36.680
I knew this journey wouldn't be smooth.

02:38.160 --> 02:41.280
I thought someone might get sick,

02:41.960 --> 02:43.440
and someone might get hurt.

02:45.240 --> 02:47.320
I believed that as long
as we were careful enough

02:47.400 --> 02:48.800
and well-prepared,

02:48.880 --> 02:50.520
we could protect them.

02:51.120 --> 02:54.760
But I never expected

02:54.840 --> 02:56.880
to lose him so suddenly.

02:57.400 --> 02:58.480
Not even a trace remains.

03:00.840 --> 03:02.720
That was Sheng Dalang!

03:03.760 --> 03:05.080
Alright.

03:05.160 --> 03:06.120
Yang Jinglan,

03:07.440 --> 03:08.800
I'm scared.

03:10.280 --> 03:12.240
Should we turn back?

03:13.120 --> 03:16.480
I don't want to see anyone else get hurt.

03:19.200 --> 03:20.040
Yingying,

03:21.240 --> 03:24.200
everyone made their own choice
to come this far.

03:25.880 --> 03:29.000
No one knows the ending at the beginning

03:30.480 --> 03:31.720
of the story.

03:42.160 --> 03:43.280
We are the leaders.

03:44.480 --> 03:46.240
We've brought everyone this far.

03:47.600 --> 03:51.640
If we back down now,

03:52.760 --> 03:54.600
how can we expect anyone to trust us

03:56.200 --> 03:57.280
to lead them

03:58.360 --> 03:59.720
through this trade route?

04:03.880 --> 04:04.960
Alright.

04:12.480 --> 04:14.320
Can we do it?

04:17.160 --> 04:18.399
We definitely can.

04:25.280 --> 04:27.400
- My brother and Yu…
- Alright.

04:27.480 --> 04:29.680
I know. I know everything.

04:30.640 --> 04:31.600
Don't worry.

04:32.240 --> 04:34.800
I promise I will bring them back
safe and sound.

04:34.880 --> 04:35.840
Okay?

04:42.920 --> 04:44.200
Big brother.

04:44.280 --> 04:45.560
It's her!

04:45.640 --> 04:47.560
That woman killed our third brother!

04:47.640 --> 04:49.080
Today, I must cut her down!

04:49.160 --> 04:50.200
Second brother, wait!

04:54.080 --> 04:55.040
Who's that man?

04:56.000 --> 04:57.320
He doesn't know martial arts.

04:57.400 --> 05:00.440
He just followed us
when we caught the woman.

05:01.800 --> 05:04.480
I also feel sad
about third brother's death.

05:05.640 --> 05:09.200
But don't forget
what our purpose of this trip is.

05:09.920 --> 05:11.080
To make money!

05:12.680 --> 05:13.680
How about this?

05:14.280 --> 05:15.520
Kill the woman

05:16.120 --> 05:17.320
to avenge our brother.

05:17.400 --> 05:19.280
Keep the man as a hostage.

05:19.960 --> 05:21.560
If you kill her, you won't get a penny!

05:22.680 --> 05:23.520
Why not?

05:24.240 --> 05:25.240
Is she valuable?

05:28.320 --> 05:30.200
Have you heard
of the Yang Brocade from Yizhou?

05:30.800 --> 05:32.600
This shipment belongs to the Yang family.

05:34.800 --> 05:35.920
Big brother,

05:36.920 --> 05:37.760
at the foot of the mountain,

05:37.840 --> 05:40.280
we saw the carriage
indeed carried the Yang family flag.

05:43.400 --> 05:44.560
The carriage is loaded with brocade.

05:47.240 --> 05:48.200
Cut off one of his fingers,

05:49.240 --> 05:51.040
take it down the mountain
to exchange for the goods.

05:51.120 --> 05:52.400
Then we'll see if it's real.

05:52.480 --> 05:54.680
If you must cut, then cut my finger.

05:55.320 --> 05:56.280
He's a brocade weaver.

05:56.360 --> 05:58.040
If you cut his finger,
you might as well take his life!

05:58.120 --> 05:59.240
No, cut mine!

05:59.320 --> 06:01.000
They only recognize my hand. Cut mine!

06:01.080 --> 06:02.440
Report!

06:06.480 --> 06:08.200
Boss, second boss,

06:08.720 --> 06:10.640
a group is chasing us up the mountain.

06:10.720 --> 06:12.200
They must be here to rescue these two.

06:12.280 --> 06:13.840
How many?

06:14.800 --> 06:16.160
Seven or eight.

06:16.240 --> 06:18.400
The leader is the one
with the highest martial skills.

06:18.480 --> 06:20.920
The others are protecting the convoy.

06:21.000 --> 06:23.360
It looks like they plan
to camp in the valley.

06:25.920 --> 06:27.720
Since they've come up the mountain,

06:27.800 --> 06:29.320
we'll change our tactics.

06:29.400 --> 06:30.480
Second brother,

06:30.560 --> 06:32.600
take these two deep into the mountains.

06:32.680 --> 06:35.360
Leave marks along the way.
Once they're far enough,

06:36.040 --> 06:37.360
I'll take the guys

06:37.440 --> 06:38.960
and surround the goods
at the foot of the mountain.

06:44.560 --> 06:45.400
Go!

06:46.560 --> 06:47.400
Go.

06:48.200 --> 06:49.040
Go!

07:00.680 --> 07:02.120
These marks are too obvious.

07:02.680 --> 07:04.120
They left them on purpose.

07:04.720 --> 07:06.480
But why would the bandits do that?

07:14.720 --> 07:15.640
General Niu.

07:20.800 --> 07:22.240
Greetings, Your Excellency.

07:26.560 --> 07:28.000
Your Excellency, you're so busy,

07:28.080 --> 07:29.800
yet you still made time to meet with me.

07:29.880 --> 07:31.400
I am deeply grateful.

07:33.160 --> 07:34.120
Enough.

07:36.560 --> 07:38.240
I've planned a family dinner for today.

07:38.320 --> 07:40.320
Let's skip the formalities.

07:41.200 --> 07:42.080
Come.

07:42.840 --> 07:44.160
- Thank you.
- Take a seat.

07:52.640 --> 07:53.720
Start with the food.

07:55.600 --> 07:57.960
Your Excellency, a few days ago in Yizhou…

07:58.040 --> 08:00.880
I remember back when you were with me,

08:01.880 --> 08:04.520
you loved this steamed shad dish.

08:04.600 --> 08:06.120
It's hard to find in Yizhou.

08:06.920 --> 08:10.200
I had it specially brought from Qiantang.

08:11.000 --> 08:12.920
Give it a try and see how it tastes.

08:21.680 --> 08:22.800
Exquisite.

08:22.880 --> 08:24.640
Your Excellency,
you remembered me so well,

08:24.720 --> 08:25.720
but I…

08:26.360 --> 08:28.800
If you find it exquisite,
have more while it's still warm.

08:28.880 --> 08:31.120
Once it cools, it will become fishy.

08:31.800 --> 08:32.799
Thank you, Your Excellency.

08:34.120 --> 08:36.880
Shad is delicious, but it has many bones.

08:38.640 --> 08:42.480
If you're too greedy and swallow it whole,

08:42.559 --> 08:45.800
you might choke on a bone.

08:54.480 --> 08:55.640
When eating shad,

08:56.400 --> 08:58.080
you must chew it slowly and carefully.

08:59.600 --> 09:03.360
Some fish, if left untouched,

09:03.880 --> 09:05.600
won't cause you any trouble,

09:06.800 --> 09:10.080
but if you're too eager,

09:10.800 --> 09:13.840
you may end up hurting yourself.

09:14.400 --> 09:15.600
Don't you agree?

09:19.760 --> 09:22.440
Your Excellency's advice
is something I will never forget.

09:24.960 --> 09:25.880
Good.

09:26.480 --> 09:27.760
Now, stand up.

09:27.840 --> 09:29.080
Thank you.

09:31.880 --> 09:32.800
Try this one too.

09:33.840 --> 09:34.680
Come on.

09:38.920 --> 09:39.760
Eat.

09:45.640 --> 09:46.480
How does it taste?

09:47.480 --> 09:48.320
Delicious.

09:59.840 --> 10:01.960
General Niu, farewell.

10:06.840 --> 10:07.920
General,

10:08.000 --> 10:09.920
what do you think
the Military Commissioner meant?

10:10.920 --> 10:13.680
Inviting me to eat
the fish I loved in my youth,

10:13.760 --> 10:16.200
then warning me not to choke on bones.

10:16.280 --> 10:17.680
What do you think he meant?

10:18.720 --> 10:20.920
Out of respect for old ties,
he's letting it go this time.

10:21.000 --> 10:23.080
But if it happens again,
there will be no mercy.

10:23.880 --> 10:25.920
So, the Military Commissioner
is still on your side.

10:28.320 --> 10:30.120
That's because he doesn't yet know

10:30.200 --> 10:32.440
that I'm dealing
with the Prince Bai of Nanzhao.

10:33.120 --> 10:35.200
Yang Jinglan will never let it slide.

10:35.280 --> 10:38.240
If he uncovers anything,
the court will press charges.

10:38.320 --> 10:40.560
Mu Hui will be the first
to throw me under the bus.

10:40.640 --> 10:43.200
When that happens,
we'll be at their mercy.

10:43.960 --> 10:44.800
So, what should we do?

10:50.280 --> 10:52.920
To be honest,
everything I have today is thanks

10:53.000 --> 10:54.120
to Military Commissioner Mu.

10:55.280 --> 10:57.480
But if that day does come…

11:04.760 --> 11:06.280
This needs to be even sharper.

11:19.920 --> 11:22.960
I see our Imperial Uncle here
has been working all day long.

11:23.040 --> 11:24.720
Sure enough, he's much steadier now.

11:25.360 --> 11:28.960
So, only by facing life and death head-on

11:29.040 --> 11:30.320
and taking life and death lightly

11:30.400 --> 11:32.360
can one go far.

11:34.160 --> 11:35.880
Are you trying to comfort me?

11:36.400 --> 11:38.960
Ms. Ji, you're a talent worth cultivating.

11:40.040 --> 11:44.280
I simply don't want to see your ambitions
wither along the way.

11:52.400 --> 11:55.240
Ms. Ji, this trap is so simple.

11:56.360 --> 11:58.760
With so many bandits, will it work?

12:00.720 --> 12:03.520
Did you really only bring Chi Hu?

12:05.960 --> 12:07.320
What do you mean by that?

12:09.760 --> 12:12.040
Some of our people
followed my husband up the mountain.

12:12.680 --> 12:15.800
The ones left now
are not enough to deal with the bandits.

12:16.480 --> 12:18.360
And you brought only one person.

12:18.440 --> 12:19.440
So,

12:20.000 --> 12:21.720
I have traps elsewhere.

12:23.240 --> 12:25.400
As expected, you have a backup plan.

12:25.480 --> 12:27.760
What use are those traps?

12:28.640 --> 12:30.720
You will see in time.

13:17.280 --> 13:18.720
May all things have spirits

13:21.480 --> 13:22.960
and take my lifespan

13:25.560 --> 13:27.040
to ensure Yingying's safety.

13:34.240 --> 13:35.360
Second boss,

13:35.440 --> 13:36.880
they've been sitting there the whole time.

13:36.960 --> 13:39.160
We tried to startle them,

13:39.240 --> 13:40.480
but they didn't move.

13:46.000 --> 13:48.160
Brothers, grip your knives tightly.

13:49.520 --> 13:50.960
If they charge at us,

13:51.040 --> 13:52.640
take one down first to set an example!

14:04.600 --> 14:05.640
Kill him!

14:18.760 --> 14:19.680
Yang Jinglan!

14:20.720 --> 14:21.960
Yu! Yaoting!

14:22.640 --> 14:23.640
- Let's go!
- Go!

14:51.600 --> 14:52.440
Where are they?

14:53.600 --> 14:56.480
Boss, over there.
They've hidden in a cave.

14:57.200 --> 15:00.520
They're hiding in the cave
and left the carriage here.

15:00.600 --> 15:02.520
Is this an offer to trade
the goods for their lives?

15:03.440 --> 15:05.200
Then, let's hurry and take the goods.

15:05.280 --> 15:06.280
Wait.

15:07.760 --> 15:09.480
Send two people down first to check.

15:11.040 --> 15:12.440
You two, go scout it out.

15:29.560 --> 15:30.480
Look.

15:48.720 --> 15:50.080
- Gou!
- Mao!

15:51.120 --> 15:52.880
There really is an ambush.

15:53.880 --> 15:54.760
What now?

16:02.800 --> 16:05.520
- Climb down the cliffside using ropes.
- Yes, sir.

16:05.600 --> 16:06.440
- Go!
- Yes!

16:22.440 --> 16:23.280
Shisi,

16:24.400 --> 16:26.800
- I'll need your help later.
- Tell me.

16:52.480 --> 16:53.520
Get ready.

17:01.320 --> 17:02.400
Drop the ropes!

17:21.400 --> 17:22.560
Ms. Ji!

17:27.079 --> 17:28.240
Boss! They're coming out!

17:29.880 --> 17:33.480
They found a trap near the carriage

17:33.560 --> 17:36.360
and will think there
are traps all around it.

17:36.880 --> 17:38.840
Even though the goods are on the carriage,

17:38.920 --> 17:41.320
they'll believe
they've fallen into a trick.

17:41.400 --> 17:42.840
Using the fake to defend the real.

17:42.920 --> 17:44.040
A brilliant plan.

17:44.120 --> 17:45.200
But you saw it too.

17:45.280 --> 17:46.800
You planned to scare them with shadows,
and they didn't fall for it.

17:46.880 --> 17:48.600
So, what will you do next?

17:49.200 --> 17:50.600
Fire the arrows!

17:57.040 --> 17:58.200
Master!

17:58.720 --> 17:59.560
Keep firing!

18:06.080 --> 18:07.600
Fire the arrows!

18:38.040 --> 18:39.400
My arm…

18:42.840 --> 18:46.560
I thought your chain traps

18:46.640 --> 18:47.760
were meant for the bandits.

18:47.840 --> 18:50.720
I didn't expect
they were prepared for me instead.

18:52.120 --> 18:53.920
Since you're not being honest,

18:54.000 --> 18:55.640
I have no choice but to take a gamble.

18:57.640 --> 18:58.920
Yingying,

18:59.000 --> 19:00.560
you guessed it right.

19:00.640 --> 19:02.680
Chi Hu led a group
and killed all the bandits!

19:04.080 --> 19:05.080
We are safe now.

19:08.320 --> 19:09.960
Thank you, Mr. Bai, for your rescue.

19:11.480 --> 19:12.320
You're welcome.

19:32.400 --> 19:33.440
With this liquor,

19:34.080 --> 19:35.720
we honor our fallen companions.

19:36.800 --> 19:38.360
May they rest in peace

19:39.000 --> 19:40.200
and watch over us.

20:02.400 --> 20:04.480
Thank you all
for believing in me and Jinglan,

20:05.080 --> 20:06.560
drawing your swords to help us,

20:06.640 --> 20:07.640
and fighting with all your might.

20:12.280 --> 20:13.280
When we reach Tubo

20:13.840 --> 20:15.000
and sell this brocade,

20:15.800 --> 20:17.040
I'll treat everyone to drinks!

20:17.120 --> 20:20.080
- Thank you, Mr. Yang and Ms. Ji!
- Thank you, Mr. Yang and Ms. Ji!

20:23.680 --> 20:25.560
Everyone, rest well tonight.

20:25.640 --> 20:28.440
Tomorrow, let's move forward!

20:28.520 --> 20:29.440
Understood!

20:50.640 --> 20:51.640
Let me handle it.

20:52.920 --> 20:55.280
These days, you've worked so hard.

20:55.880 --> 20:57.480
You should take a good rest too.

21:25.120 --> 21:27.080
Easy. Be very gentle.

21:27.680 --> 21:28.760
Don't worry.

21:28.840 --> 21:31.160
This medicine specializes
in treating bumps and strains.

21:31.240 --> 21:32.280
You'll be fine in a couple of days.

21:37.120 --> 21:40.240
I've been thinking.
Is it really useful for us to be here?

21:41.200 --> 21:43.040
It's not that I can't endure hardship,

21:43.120 --> 21:46.080
but look at my build, my frame,
and my timid nature.

21:47.800 --> 21:49.080
Can I really be of any help?

21:49.960 --> 21:51.040
In this caravan,

21:51.120 --> 21:53.720
everyone has different roles to play.

21:53.800 --> 21:56.240
The guards' skill is to protect the goods.

21:56.320 --> 21:57.320
We are merchants.

21:57.400 --> 22:00.400
Our skill is to do good business
when we reach Tubo

22:00.480 --> 22:01.480
and sell the goods.

22:02.080 --> 22:03.640
So, it's not that we are incapable.

22:03.720 --> 22:05.680
It's just that our moment hasn't come yet.

22:07.240 --> 22:08.920
Impressive, Sheng Dalang.

22:09.000 --> 22:10.240
Since when did you learn
to talk like this?

22:12.320 --> 22:13.560
What was that saying again?

22:13.640 --> 22:16.160
"Part for three days…"
Something like that.

22:16.240 --> 22:18.520
"Part for three days,
and you'll see them in a new light."

22:18.600 --> 22:19.920
Yes!

22:20.000 --> 22:21.880
"Part for three days,
and you'll see them in a new light!"

22:22.760 --> 22:23.600
Easy.

22:26.320 --> 22:27.760
Honestly, I have to thank you for this.

22:30.240 --> 22:31.960
If it weren't for you,

22:32.040 --> 22:35.280
I wouldn't have come this far,
seen all these things,

22:35.360 --> 22:36.480
or said these words.

22:37.280 --> 22:39.320
Why thank me? I didn't do much.

22:39.400 --> 22:41.400
Don't you remember? You taught me

22:42.480 --> 22:43.800
to be brave and raise my hand,

22:43.880 --> 22:44.960
to be brave and step forward.

22:45.040 --> 22:46.320
So, this time, I came out.

22:51.520 --> 22:53.400
Exactly. Be brave and raise your hand.

22:53.480 --> 22:54.440
Be brave and step forward.

22:56.520 --> 22:58.880
Don't worry.
I'll take good care of everyone.

22:59.840 --> 23:00.920
You definitely can.

23:10.520 --> 23:12.640
Are you planning to keep carrying it?

23:16.560 --> 23:18.080
Sheng Dalang died for me.

23:29.640 --> 23:30.720
Yang Jinglan,

23:30.800 --> 23:32.520
I'm just a worthless person.

23:34.080 --> 23:36.400
I even promised
Sheng Dalang to take care of everyone.

23:37.240 --> 23:39.880
But now, not only did
I fail to take care of everyone,

23:40.680 --> 23:41.800
I also caused his death.

23:44.320 --> 23:45.560
I shouldn't have come.

23:50.640 --> 23:53.160
Joining this caravan was your own choice.

23:53.240 --> 23:54.400
If you want to leave now,

23:55.200 --> 23:56.560
no one can stop you.

23:58.720 --> 23:59.560
So,

24:00.320 --> 24:02.320
you think I'm worthless too, don't you?

24:16.000 --> 24:16.960
Sang Shisi,

24:18.840 --> 24:20.280
the path we're on now

24:21.040 --> 24:22.600
is one no one has walked before.

24:23.200 --> 24:24.880
We must face all the hardships and dangers

24:26.640 --> 24:27.800
along the way.

24:29.400 --> 24:31.880
Whether good or bad,

24:33.480 --> 24:34.920
we must fully accept them.

24:36.720 --> 24:37.840
Besides,

24:37.920 --> 24:40.360
you are the honorary president
of Bloom Society.

24:40.920 --> 24:43.920
Don't you think this caravan needs you?

24:49.120 --> 24:50.160
So, what should we do now?

24:53.040 --> 24:54.480
By choosing this path,

24:55.240 --> 24:57.560
you've already proven you're brave.

25:00.920 --> 25:02.480
As for the road ahead,

25:05.520 --> 25:06.960
only you can decide.

25:23.560 --> 25:25.160
If you ever treat me badly,

25:27.280 --> 25:28.520
I'll kill you.

25:36.040 --> 25:37.960
I… I'll definitely treat you well!

25:38.040 --> 25:39.360
I'll only treat you well!

25:39.440 --> 25:40.480
I'll just treat you well.

25:42.840 --> 25:44.400
I've faced death.

25:47.640 --> 25:49.400
Why should I fear loving again?

25:57.840 --> 25:58.680
Master,

25:59.400 --> 26:00.400
something's happened in Yizhou.

26:03.480 --> 26:04.480
Should we

26:05.120 --> 26:06.680
return earlier than planned?

26:10.640 --> 26:12.800
By the time we return to Yizhou,

26:12.880 --> 26:16.040
the craftsmen there
will likely turn against us.

26:20.760 --> 26:22.680
- Chi Hu.
- Here.

26:23.760 --> 26:26.320
Prepare a gift for me.

26:27.000 --> 26:27.840
Understood.

26:44.920 --> 26:46.480
Mr. Bai, you're not resting yet?

26:51.120 --> 26:52.440
What a lovely night it is.

26:57.040 --> 26:57.920
Oh,

26:58.880 --> 27:00.000
Ms. Ji,

27:01.000 --> 27:02.360
would you like to hear a story?

27:04.920 --> 27:06.440
Once, there was a child.

27:07.480 --> 27:12.400
His mother was taken
by his father to be his wife.

27:14.600 --> 27:18.440
She was always unhappy, never smiling.

27:19.880 --> 27:23.080
But whenever she wore

27:23.160 --> 27:27.000
the brocade garment
she brought from her hometown,

27:28.200 --> 27:29.160
she would

27:30.400 --> 27:31.640
light up with joy.

27:35.480 --> 27:36.640
The child

27:37.560 --> 27:39.480
wished for his mother
to be happy every day.

27:40.760 --> 27:42.920
So, he begged his master

27:43.480 --> 27:46.640
to bring more brocade garments
from her hometown.

27:47.920 --> 27:50.160
He hoped that his own hometown

27:50.240 --> 27:54.000
could be as full of brocade as hers.

27:55.440 --> 27:58.880
Only then did he believe

27:59.560 --> 28:01.200
she wouldn't miss her hometown

28:01.840 --> 28:05.520
and would consider this place her home.

28:08.160 --> 28:09.880
I can understand that child.

28:11.560 --> 28:14.720
But if that determination
could be channeled for a good cause,

28:15.560 --> 28:17.320
it wouldn't be a bad thing.

28:25.280 --> 28:27.320
Alright, no more stories.

28:29.240 --> 28:33.360
Ms. Ji, here is a gift for you.

28:34.280 --> 28:37.240
May you find
great success in your business.

28:37.320 --> 28:38.440
Look…

29:00.640 --> 29:04.360
These fireworks are different
from any I've seen before.

29:08.280 --> 29:09.120
Yes,

29:09.920 --> 29:11.080
I've never seen

29:12.120 --> 29:13.320
fireworks like these either.

29:15.400 --> 29:17.160
I was wondering where Mr. Bai had gone.

29:17.240 --> 29:19.960
Turns out he was here,
trying to charm my wife.

29:25.880 --> 29:28.320
Every burst of fireworks says

29:28.880 --> 29:32.200
I wishes to maintain
a lasting friendship with Ms. Ji.

29:35.480 --> 29:38.600
If you could be sincere,

29:39.160 --> 29:43.080
I, too, hope you and my wife
can maintain a lasting friendship.

29:50.360 --> 29:54.760
Every word I say is from the heart,
honest and open.

29:56.200 --> 29:58.560
There was a time
I wanted to be friends with you.

29:59.160 --> 30:02.000
But you refused me yourself.

30:02.560 --> 30:03.480
Have you forgotten?

30:06.680 --> 30:08.640
No matter when you're in trouble,

30:08.720 --> 30:11.440
as long as it doesn't violate morality
or break the law,

30:11.520 --> 30:13.880
I'm willing to help you through it.

30:15.200 --> 30:18.440
That's my promise to a friend.

30:18.520 --> 30:21.640
UNYIELDING RESOLVE

30:27.120 --> 30:29.080
Alright. It's late.

30:29.160 --> 30:30.520
I should head back.

30:32.560 --> 30:33.400
Farewell.

30:34.480 --> 30:35.360
I won't see you off.

30:41.440 --> 30:44.280
Dear, what do you think

30:45.600 --> 30:46.640
those fireworks meant?

30:51.920 --> 30:53.000
Whatever the intention,

30:53.640 --> 30:56.040
if he dares to draw his dagger at the end,

30:56.640 --> 30:58.720
we'll take decisive action.

31:16.840 --> 31:18.040
General,

31:18.120 --> 31:19.600
there's news from Yizhou City.

31:19.680 --> 31:22.320
Yang Jinglan's men went to Prince Bai's
residence to arrest someone.

31:22.960 --> 31:24.840
Afterward, they also detained
a foreign merchant caravan.

31:25.760 --> 31:27.360
Yang Jinglan's men?

31:28.440 --> 31:31.080
Does his little Brocade Bureau
have that many people?

31:32.800 --> 31:34.200
And they dare to arrest foreign merchants?

31:35.840 --> 31:38.040
It seems this is an order from Chang'an.

31:38.680 --> 31:39.520
Does this mean…

31:40.680 --> 31:42.440
Chang'an is really
going to investigate thoroughly?

31:45.400 --> 31:48.200
What was Governor Zhang's response
after Yang Jinglan made the arrests?

31:48.800 --> 31:50.400
He shut his doors
and acted as if he knew nothing.

31:51.440 --> 31:52.880
If Governor Zhang doesn't act,

31:52.960 --> 31:54.480
it means the Military Commissioner
doesn't want to intervene.

31:55.240 --> 31:56.480
But if something happens,

31:58.960 --> 32:00.760
would the Military Commissioner
truly abandon us?

32:10.000 --> 32:11.160
Good morning, Mr. Bai.

32:14.680 --> 32:17.480
Why are you so proactive today?

32:21.800 --> 32:23.400
This trip to Yizhou,

32:24.320 --> 32:26.560
the greatest gain for me has been

32:26.640 --> 32:28.600
meeting you, Ms. Ji and Mr. Yang.

32:28.680 --> 32:30.280
It's because of you two

32:30.360 --> 32:33.760
that I have seen the extraordinary people
and beauty of Shu.

32:34.960 --> 32:37.120
But all good things must come to an end.

32:37.200 --> 32:38.920
I must take my leave.

32:42.960 --> 32:44.720
We're so close to Tubo now.

32:44.800 --> 32:47.600
Wouldn't leaving at this moment be a pity?

32:48.480 --> 32:51.600
From here on,
you must continue the journey alone.

32:53.520 --> 32:56.280
This place is close to my hometown.

32:56.840 --> 32:59.000
I miss home
and want to go back for a visit.

33:00.840 --> 33:03.640
Ms. Ji, once you return from Tubo,

33:03.720 --> 33:05.480
I'll host a celebration for you here.

33:08.760 --> 33:11.360
Mr. Bai, I'm afraid
you won't be able to return home.

33:12.320 --> 33:13.720
A letter arrived from Yizhou yesterday,

33:13.800 --> 33:15.040
claiming that a foreign merchant
dared to collude

33:15.120 --> 33:18.320
with Yizhou officials
to smuggle tribute brocade for years.

33:18.400 --> 33:19.400
This year, it escalated.

33:20.040 --> 33:21.880
They even dared to steal confidential
pattern designs from various families

33:21.960 --> 33:23.280
and smuggled them to Nanzhao.

33:24.160 --> 33:27.680
It was said
that all of this was planned by you.

33:28.600 --> 33:29.840
Mr. Bai,

33:29.920 --> 33:33.040
I have no choice
but to detain you temporarily.

33:36.560 --> 33:40.040
Let's not discuss
whether there's a misunderstanding.

33:40.840 --> 33:43.080
You're an official of Yizhou.

33:43.160 --> 33:44.960
You have no authority
over the people of Nanzhao.

33:45.760 --> 33:49.600
Anyone doing business in Tang
must follow Tang laws.

33:50.120 --> 33:50.960
Guards!

33:56.200 --> 33:58.400
Detain Mr. Bai temporarily.

33:59.320 --> 34:01.320
Yang Jinglan, stop being rude!

34:27.760 --> 34:30.600
We warmly welcome
Prince Bai back to Nanzhao!

34:36.199 --> 34:37.320
Prince?

34:38.560 --> 34:41.600
Do you need me
to show you my credentials and token?

34:42.600 --> 34:43.440
No need.

34:45.719 --> 34:48.360
I never intended to hide my identity.

34:48.440 --> 34:49.920
It's just that this identity

34:50.520 --> 34:52.960
makes it inconvenient to act in Yizhou.

34:53.040 --> 34:56.239
Ms. Ji, shall we reintroduce ourselves?

34:57.520 --> 35:00.240
I am Sheng Fengze,
the Prince Bai of Nanzhao.

35:01.600 --> 35:03.960
Since you're the Prince Bai of Nanzhao,
then this is all the more convenient.

35:04.560 --> 35:05.880
Along with yesterday's letter from Yizhou,

35:05.960 --> 35:08.040
there was also an edict from Chang'an.

35:08.120 --> 35:11.240
We respectfully invite Prince Bai
to meet the Emperor in Chang'an.

35:12.560 --> 35:14.520
What if I don't want to go?

35:14.600 --> 35:19.480
I believe the Emperor of Tang
wouldn't force you to compel me.

35:21.360 --> 35:22.680
Not going is fine.

35:22.760 --> 35:24.720
But those foreign merchants' testimonies

35:25.320 --> 35:27.560
will all be handed over
to the King of Nanzhao.

35:27.640 --> 35:29.000
I'm confident the King of Nanzhao

35:29.080 --> 35:30.880
will provide Tang
with a reasonable explanation.

35:32.960 --> 35:35.880
The people of Nanzhao all know
that I am unwell,

35:35.960 --> 35:37.280
resting in my residence,

35:37.960 --> 35:40.520
yet you claim to have seen me in Yizhou.

35:40.600 --> 35:43.960
Tell me. Could someone
be impersonating me?

35:44.040 --> 35:47.760
All the more reason to go to Chang'an
and verify your identity.

35:52.840 --> 35:55.240
Instead, Mr. Bai,

35:55.960 --> 35:58.400
no, Prince Bai,

35:58.480 --> 35:59.680
why not make a deal with us?

36:00.920 --> 36:03.800
Dear, you're trying
to get blood from a stone.

36:03.880 --> 36:04.720
Fine.

36:05.360 --> 36:06.960
I was thinking the same thing.

36:07.040 --> 36:10.040
I do enjoy doing business
with you, Ms. Ji.

36:11.320 --> 36:14.160
Mr. Bai, may I have a word with you?

36:32.920 --> 36:34.640
Now that you refuse to go to Chang'an

36:35.360 --> 36:37.560
and my husband refuses
to let you return to Nanzhao,

36:38.240 --> 36:39.920
rather than this stalemate,

36:40.000 --> 36:43.080
which could lead to fight
and mutual destruction,

36:43.800 --> 36:45.040
why not take a step back?

36:47.360 --> 36:48.240
Yingying!

36:50.520 --> 36:51.920
Yang Jinglan,

36:52.000 --> 36:54.440
I don't want to see anyone else get hurt.

36:54.520 --> 36:55.480
By holding this stalemate,

36:55.560 --> 36:57.200
you're just waiting
for the people from Chang'an

36:57.280 --> 37:00.200
to join you
in a life-or-death fight against them.

37:00.280 --> 37:02.040
But have you thought
about the caravan members?

37:02.120 --> 37:03.200
What about them?

37:03.280 --> 37:04.920
With Prince Bai's indifference,

37:05.480 --> 37:07.080
how could he care about their lives?

37:07.160 --> 37:09.880
It seems Ms. Ji truly understands me.

37:12.080 --> 37:14.560
But Prince Bai,
you also understand my husband well.

37:15.480 --> 37:17.960
When he charged back
into Yizhou alone, cutting down foes,

37:18.040 --> 37:19.280
it was ruthless.

37:20.560 --> 37:23.520
If you push him too hard,
no matter how many people you have,

37:23.600 --> 37:27.760
he could justify killing you
as an accident during duty.

37:27.840 --> 37:31.600
Ms. Ji, you have laid it all out plainly.

37:32.240 --> 37:33.960
If I'm not mistaken,

37:34.040 --> 37:38.000
the next topic should be
about mutually beneficial cooperation.

37:42.560 --> 37:44.280
We crossed paths with you

37:45.680 --> 37:47.440
because we were investigating Niu Jin.

37:49.440 --> 37:51.160
I believe your collaboration with Niu Jin

37:51.240 --> 37:53.240
is purely for profit,

37:53.320 --> 37:55.080
not out of genuine friendship.

38:02.160 --> 38:06.080
You suddenly bring up General Niu,

38:08.480 --> 38:11.640
but there is no bond
between me and General Niu.

38:19.560 --> 38:21.560
If I offer you greater benefits,

38:22.960 --> 38:24.480
would you be willing
to make some sacrifices?

38:27.960 --> 38:29.240
I'd like to hear

38:30.240 --> 38:31.480
what these benefits are.

38:35.640 --> 38:36.560
Ji Yingying,

38:37.680 --> 38:40.360
do you intend to let him go
and only capture Niu Jin?

38:40.440 --> 38:42.920
We both know what kind of person he is.

38:43.000 --> 38:46.320
Today, if we collude with him,

38:46.400 --> 38:48.560
we'll be stained forever!

38:48.640 --> 38:50.200
But what good does capturing him do?

38:50.960 --> 38:53.880
Would the Tang authority
punish a Nanzhao prince

38:53.960 --> 38:55.160
over a trivial tribute brocade
smuggling case?

38:55.840 --> 38:56.960
Unafraid of power,

38:57.760 --> 38:59.000
determined to uncover the truth,

38:59.560 --> 39:00.880
and never compromising.

39:00.960 --> 39:02.240
Have you forgotten all of this?

39:02.320 --> 39:03.400
I haven't forgotten!

39:05.560 --> 39:06.960
I'm just scared.

39:08.520 --> 39:10.400
I'm afraid of more people getting hurt,

39:10.480 --> 39:11.600
more incidents happening.

39:12.160 --> 39:13.720
I can't wait any longer.

39:14.320 --> 39:16.760
For revenge, I endured for nine years.

39:16.840 --> 39:18.120
A whole nine years.

39:19.080 --> 39:20.600
But now Niu Jin is watching us,

39:20.680 --> 39:22.320
ready to strike at any moment.

39:23.000 --> 39:24.600
I can't endure it any longer.

39:25.520 --> 39:27.600
This is the best choice
after weighing all the pros and cons.

39:28.760 --> 39:29.640
Yang Jinglan,

39:30.880 --> 39:32.600
this time, listen to me, alright?

39:33.840 --> 39:34.840
Yang Jinglan!

39:36.080 --> 39:36.920
Please, I beg you.

39:50.640 --> 39:51.520
Sheng Fengze,

39:53.440 --> 39:54.440
if you admit

39:55.000 --> 39:57.240
that Niu Jin smuggled
tribute brocade to Nanzhao,

39:57.320 --> 39:58.920
I can tell the court

39:59.480 --> 40:00.960
that you were deceived by Niu Jin.

40:01.880 --> 40:03.400
As for the testimonies
from those merchants,

40:05.680 --> 40:06.760
I'll leave it to you to handle.

40:10.360 --> 40:11.440
Mr. Yang,

40:12.600 --> 40:15.160
I know you're resourceful.

40:15.240 --> 40:17.800
If you go back on your word,

40:17.880 --> 40:20.080
where could I possibly seek justice?

40:20.160 --> 40:22.040
We Tang people keep our word.

40:24.200 --> 40:25.040
Alright.

40:25.960 --> 40:27.080
Since this is a deal,

40:27.640 --> 40:30.240
there should be some guarantee, right?

40:32.800 --> 40:34.200
What do you want?

40:35.080 --> 40:37.600
Mr. Yang goes to Chang'an to negotiate,

40:41.480 --> 40:44.520
and I accompany Ji Yingying to Tubo.

40:44.600 --> 40:47.760
Then I'll bring Ji Yingying
to visit Nanzhao as a guest.

40:48.320 --> 40:49.400
You're dreaming.

40:50.960 --> 40:52.280
You can come for her

40:52.360 --> 40:54.200
after you've killed
Niu Jin and fulfill your vengeance!

40:59.680 --> 41:03.000
I know
you're highly skilled in martial arts.

41:03.560 --> 41:05.920
Mr. Yang, tell me.

41:06.000 --> 41:09.520
Can the caravan members
avoid those crossbows?

41:14.480 --> 41:17.960
Ms. Ji said something I liked very much.

41:18.040 --> 41:20.400
She said that in business,

41:20.480 --> 41:22.600
we must learn to trust each other

41:23.160 --> 41:24.400
and make mutual concessions.

41:25.000 --> 41:25.920
What do you think?

41:29.160 --> 41:31.320
Alright. Mutual concessions.

41:32.760 --> 41:33.840
If you admit it,

41:34.640 --> 41:36.240
then I agree to your terms.

41:40.200 --> 41:41.320
I never thought

41:41.840 --> 41:43.480
you could be so straightforward.

41:44.120 --> 41:46.000
Fine. Then today,

41:46.760 --> 41:48.200
I will also be straightforward.

41:50.560 --> 41:54.840
I admit to smuggling
tribute brocade with Niu Jin.

42:00.960 --> 42:01.800
Alright.

42:05.200 --> 42:07.800
Since we've all heard it, come out now!

42:12.280 --> 42:15.760
Yang Jinglan,
I've brought the people you wanted.

42:19.520 --> 42:21.080
When we get to Chang'an,
I'll buy you a drink!

42:26.800 --> 42:29.720
Come on. Show Prince Bai your identities!

42:30.720 --> 42:32.920
Ministry of Personnel Guard,
Zhang Tingyan.

42:33.000 --> 42:34.720
Ministry of War Guard, Zhao Xun.

42:34.800 --> 42:36.480
Ministry of Justice Guard, He Dapeng.

42:37.080 --> 42:38.680
Ministry of Revenue Guard, Wang Zhaofang.

42:38.760 --> 42:40.240
Ministry of Works Guard, Wu Xinfei.

42:40.840 --> 42:42.720
Imperial Qianniu Guard, Zhao Meng.

42:43.720 --> 42:46.360
We respectfully invite
Prince Bai to Chang'an!

42:47.000 --> 42:48.680
Too bad they came at a bad time.

42:48.760 --> 42:51.400
Everything you just said
was heard by them all.

42:51.480 --> 42:55.200
That means the court of Tang
is now fully aware.

42:57.400 --> 42:58.280
Sheng Fengze,

43:00.160 --> 43:03.560
not all evidence needs to be written down.

43:07.560 --> 43:09.920
Prince Bai, please.

43:10.000 --> 43:12.800
We respectfully invite
Prince Bai to Chang'an!

43:13.880 --> 43:15.440
It seems

43:15.520 --> 43:17.080
I'll have to make
the trip to Chang'an after all.

43:17.160 --> 43:18.120
Indeed.
